NOTE: Differentiate Crypto Maps vs GRE over IPSec: 
IPSEC Profiles can be applied to interfaces

Steps to configure S2S VPN (GRE Over IPSec)

1. Set a ISAKMP Policy (Phase 1)

conf t
 crypto isakmp policy 1
  authentication pre-share
  encryption aes 256
  hash sha512
  group 14
  lifetime 86400
  exit
 crypto isakmp key VPN-Bkey address __.__.__.__
  end


2. Set a IPSec Transform-set (Phase 2)

conf t
 crypto ipsec transform-set IPSEC_SET esp-aes esp-sha512-hmac
  mode transport
  exit


3. Set an IPSec Profile

conf t
 crypto ipsec profile VPN-PROFILE
  set transform-set IPSEC-SET
  set pfs group14
  end


4. Create a GRE Tunnel

conf t
 int tun1
  ip add 172.16.1.1 255.255.255.0
  tunnel source e0/0
  tunnel destination __.__.__.__
  tunnel mode gre ip
  end

5. Apply IPSec to tunnel

conf t
 int tun1
  tunnel protection ipsec profile VPN-PROFILE
  end

6. Define Interesting Traffic

conf t
 ip route __.__.__.__  __.__.__.__  172.16.1.2
 end
